     "sub": "King of Persia",
     "t0": 0.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Herodotus says millions. Historians today say maybe two hundred thousand.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "campo_batalha-indo-dourado",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.0,
      1.08
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": []
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Either way, more men than the whole of Sparta.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "esparta_cidade-praca",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.08,
      1.0
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.45
    },
    "fx": []
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "The oracle of *Delphi* gave Sparta a terrible answer.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "esparta_cidade-templo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.2,
      1.32
     ],
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.66
    },
    "fx": [
     "chuva"
    ],
    "atores": [
     {
      "id": "leonidas",
      "pose": "parado",
      "rosto": "determinado",
      "v": 0.93,
      "esc": 1.0,
      "arma": false,
      "u": 0.5
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "texto": "Either your city burns, or a king of Sparta dies.",
   "pausa": 0.5,
   "cena": {
    "fundo": "esparta_cidade-templo-tempestade",
    "cam": {
     "z": [
      1.6,
